[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0673","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0673.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21214","title":"Microsoft Windows BitLocker 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows BitLocker 存在信息泄露漏洞，具有物理访问权限的攻击者在满足高复杂度攻击条件的情况下，可能通过特定硬件调试接口或内存分析技术绕过 BitLocker 加密保护，读取本应受保护的系统卷中的敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Windows 10、Windows 11 及 Windows Server 各版本，CVSS 评分 4.2，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21214"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:47Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049984)，通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取。如无法立即打补丁，可在 BitLocker 加密完成后移除页面文件中的敏感数据残留，或限制对系统卷的物理访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21214","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2025/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21214","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21214.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21214"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0673.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0672","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0672.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21213","title":"Microsoft Windows Secure Boot 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows Secure Boot 安全功能存在绕过漏洞，属于访问控制缺陷（CWE-284）。具有物理访问权限的攻击者可通过在系统启动过程中绕过 Secure Boot 完整性验证机制，破坏安全启动链的信任根，从而加载未签名的恶意代码或未经授权的操作系统。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，机密性影响为高，但需要攻击者具备物理接触目标设备的能力，降低了实际利用的便捷性。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049981）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21213"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Windows 10 22H2/21H2 安装 KB5049981（OS Builds 19044.5371 / 19045.5371），Windows Server 2019 安装 KB5050008（OS Build 17763.6775），Windows 11 对应版本安装 2025 年 1 月累积更新。同时进入 UEFI 固件设置确认 Secure Boot 处于启用状态，并吊销已知不安全的第三方 UEFI 证书。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21213","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2025/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21213","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21213.json","https://github.com/Wack0/bitlocker-attacks"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0672.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0670","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0670.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21211","title":"Microsoft Windows Secure Boot 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows Secure Boot 安全功能存在绕过漏洞，具有物理访问权限的攻击者可通过在系统启动过程中加载未签名的恶意引导程序，绕过 Secure Boot 的安全验证机制，从而在目标系统上执行未授权的代码并获取高权限控制。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 6.8，危害等级中等。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21211"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:46Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049981），通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多版本，更新后对应版本号：Win10 1507 需 ≥10.0.10240.20890，Win10 22H2 需 ≥10.0.19045.5371，Win11 24H2 需 ≥10.0.26100.2894，Server 2022 需 ≥10.0.20348.3091。如无法立即打补丁，建议在 UEFI 固件设置中启用 Secure Boot 并确保平台密钥（PK）为最新，同时限制物理访问以防止本地利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21211","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2025/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21211","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21211.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21211.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0670.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0669","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0669.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21210","title":"Microsoft Windows BitLocker 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows BitLocker 存在信息泄露漏洞（CVE-2025-21210）。攻击者通过物理访问目标设备，利用 BitLocker 加密处理机制中的缺陷，在满足高复杂度攻击条件的情况下可能获取本应受加密保护的敏感数据，造成机密信息泄露。该漏洞无法通过网络远程利用（CVSS 向量 AV:P 要求物理访问，AC:H 利用复杂度高），影响范围涵盖 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 各版本。Microsoft 已通过 2025 年 1 月安全更新修复该漏洞，建议用户及时安装补丁并加强 BitLocker 密钥管理与物理安全防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21210"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:46Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（Windows 11 对应 KB5049984、Windows 10 对应 KB5049981/5049983），可通过「设置→Windows 更新→检查更新」或 Windows Update 自动更新完成安装。如暂时无法打补丁，可限制攻击者对受控设备的物理访问、妥善保管 BitLocker 恢复密钥并启用 TPM 与增强型安全启动（强制完整性保护）作为临时缓解措施，降低本地信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21210","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2025/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21210","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21210.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21210"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0669.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0667","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0667.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21207","title":"Microsoft Windows Connected Devices Platform Service (Cdpsvc) 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Connected Devices Platform Service (Cdpsvc) 存在拒绝服务漏洞，该漏洞源于服务对特制请求的处理不当，导致未受控制的资源消耗（CWE-400）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标系统发送特制请求，利用该漏洞导致 Cdpsvc 服务停止响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（补丁号 5049981）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21207"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:46Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049981)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或网络边界限制对 Cdpsvc 服务端口的访问，并监控异常网络流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21207","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2025/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21207.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21207","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21207.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0667.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0662","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0662.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21202","title":"Microsoft Windows Recovery Environment Agent 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 恢复环境代理（Windows Recovery Environment Agent）存在不当访问控制漏洞，由于对系统资源的权限管理不严，具有物理访问权限的攻击者可通过在目标系统上运行特制程序触发该漏洞，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别，进而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21202"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:45Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 KB5049981（适用于 Windows 10 21H2/22H2，OS Builds 19044.5371 和 19045.5371），或通过 Windows Update 获取最新累积更新。该漏洞影响 Windows 恢复环境代理，需同时确保 WinRE 映像已更新（可通过 `reagentc /enable` 检查状态后，运行 `DISM /Online /Cleanup-Image /StartComponentCleanup /ResetBase` 更新 WinRE 分区）。由于攻击需要物理访问（AV:P），作为临时缓解措施，应限制对目标设备的物理接触并启用 BitLocker 和 Secure Boot。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21202","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b51e2278437c32dc795d5eaa3888baba6465f89d/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-21202.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/52ab10bd804e22d7a1e3ce8d118700d9c56bd957/2025/CVE-2025-21202.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21202.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21202.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/b51e2278437c32dc795d5eaa3888baba6465f89d/data/2025/CVE-2025-21202-7amzahard_CVE-2025-21202-exploit.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21202.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21202.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-21202.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21202.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21202.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0662.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0654","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0654.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21193","title":"Microsoft Active Directory Federation Server 欺骗漏洞","description":"Active Directory 联合身份验证服务（AD FS）存在欺骗漏洞，该漏洞与跨站请求伪造（CSRF）相关。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱导已登录用户访问恶意构造的链接或网页，利用该漏洞在目标用户的浏览器上下文中执行未授权的操作，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者需要用户交互才能利用此漏洞，影响 Windows 系统的 AD FS 组件。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049983）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21193"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:44Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049983），该更新修复了 Windows Server 2016（版本 10.0.14393.7699）、Windows Server 2019（版本 10.0.17763.6775）、Windows Server 2022（版本 10.0.20348.3091）及 Windows Server 2025（版本 10.0.26100.2894）上的 AD FS 欺骗漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可限制对 AD FS 服务器的网络访问并启用增强型跨站请求伪造（CSRF）防护措施作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21193","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2025/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21193.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21193"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0654.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0651","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0651.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21189","title":"Microsoft Windows MapUrlToZone 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows MapUrlToZone 存在安全功能绕过漏洞。该函数用于将 URL 映射到对应的安全区域（如 Internet、本地 Intranet、受信任站点等），但由于对 URL 的解析逻辑存在缺陷，攻击者可通过诱导用户点击特制链接或访问恶意网页，绕过 Internet 区域的限制策略，使本应受严格限制的网页内容被错误地分配到权限更高的安全区域，导致机密性受到低度影响。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需提前获取用户权限，但需要用户交互。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21189"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:43Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，或通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。受影响的 Windows 版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2008 至 2025，更新后各版本对应内核版本号分别为：Windows 10 1507 升级至 10.0.10240.20890、Windows 11 24H2 升级至 10.0.26100.2894 等。如无法立即打补丁，可配置 Internet 安全区域为高等级并限制不可信来源的 URL 访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21189","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/b258f1790af19a85ccc98f5e771360cd7a4cb4d7/2025/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21189","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21189.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21189"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0651.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0649","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0649.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21187","title":"Microsoft Power Automate 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Power Automate for Desktop 存在代码注入漏洞（CWE-94），由于对用户输入验证不严，攻击者可通过构造特制的自动化流文件诱导用户打开，触发远程代码执行。成功利用此漏洞可导致机密性、完整性和可用性均遭完全破坏。攻击需用户交互，无需身份认证，影响 Power Automate for Desktop 多个版本（2.46 至 2.51 系列及更早版本）。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21187"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:43Z","remediation":"立即将 Microsoft Power Automate for Desktop 升级至 2.52.62.25009 及以上版本。各旧分支对应修复版本：2.46.x→2.46.184.25013、2.47.x→2.47.126.25010、2.48.x→2.48.164.25010、2.49.x→2.49.182.25010、2.50.x→2.50.139.25010、2.51.x→2.51.349.24355。可通过 Microsoft Update 目录或 Power Automate 内置更新通道获取。临时缓解措施：限制用户运行不受信任的 Power Automate 流，并启用 Windows Defender Attack Surface Reduction 规则阻止 Office 应用程序创建子进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21187","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03d