6.0.5483.1001 及以上版本。Microsoft 365 Apps for Enterprise 及 Office LTSC 2021/2024 用户需安装对应 Office 安全更新。临时缓解措施：不要打开来自不可信来源的 Access 数据库文件（.accdb/.mdb）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21186","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2720049fa2ff0728cf5af8a5d5207201a53780f6/2025/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21186.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-21186"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0648.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0640","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0640.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21178","title":"Microsoft Visual Studio 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Visual Studio 存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过构造特制的项目文件或代码片段，诱导用户使用 Visual Studio 打开后触发该漏洞。成功利用此漏洞的攻击者可获得与当前用户相同的权限，在目标系统上执行任意代码，实现完全控制受影响的系统（机密性、完整性、可用性均受高影响）。该漏洞影响 Visual Studio 2015 Update 3、2017、2019 及 2022 多个版本系列，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21178"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:42Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新，将 Visual Studio 升级至以下修复版本：Visual Studio 2015 Update 3 升级到 14.0.24252.2 及以上；Visual Studio 2017 (15.9) 升级到 15.9.69 及以上；Visual Studio 2019 (16.11) 升级到 16.11.43 及以上；Visual Studio 2022 (17.6) 升级到 17.6.22 及以上；Visual Studio 2022 (17.8) 升级到 17.8.17 及以上；Visual Studio 2022 (17.10) 升级到 17.10.10 及以上；Visual Studio 2022 (17.12) 升级到 17.12.4 及以上。可通过 Visual Studio 内置检查更新功能或访问 https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21178 获取补丁。临时缓解措施包括限制用户打开来自不可信来源的解决方案文件，并启用 Windows Defender Exploit Guard 缓解堆缓冲区溢出攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21178","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/bb000df9f27fa146ab353b5455f4a8607b3ce719/2025/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21178.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-21178"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0640.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0638","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0638.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21176","title":"Microsoft .NET、.NET Framework 及 Visual Studio 远程代码执行漏洞","description":".NET、.NET Framework 及 Visual Studio 存在远程代码执行漏洞。该漏洞源于相关组件在解析特制的 .NET 程序集（assembly）时对输入数据校验不充分，导致内存内容被错误处理，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意项目文件或编译并加载包含缺陷的代码，进而在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。成功利用该漏洞可导致信息泄露、权限提升乃至完全控制受影响系统。攻击前提是受害用户需先打开或执行攻击者提供的恶意文件或程序集，攻击展现了较高的复杂度评估而非高。Microsoft 已发布安全更新缓解，建议用户及时应用相关修复程序并避免打开不可信来源的文件。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21176"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:42Z","remediation":"请立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新，升级 .NET/.NET Framework/Visual Studio 至包含修复的版本：.NET 8.0 升级到 8.0.13 及以上、.NET 9.0 升级到 9.0.4 及以上，.NET Framework 安装对应 \"January 2025\" 更新 KB；Visual Studio 通过检查更新升级到已修复的 2022 17.x 最新版本。可通过 nuget.org 下载补丁包或使用 dotnet-install 脚本更新运行时/SDK，Windows 用户使用 Windows Update 自动获取 .NET Framework 补丁。若无法立即升级，限制信任边界访问，仅运行来自可信来源的未验证输入内容，并在部署环境降低攻击面，同时关注 Microsoft 公告 3212824 以获取更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21176","https://www.herodevs.com/vulnerability-directory/cve-2025-21176","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-36855.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e10116715f6c5d14f0b7f3bdd8bc5f9d5b3b368/release-notes/9.0/cve.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e10116715f6c5d14f0b7f3bdd8bc5f9d5b3b368/release-notes/8.0/cve.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21176.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21176.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21176.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4e910e4fa4fa60cd85b2b05bafb6fc9b27009a2d/proposals/owasp-asi/CVE-2025-21176.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21176.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-21176.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-21176.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0638.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0636","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0636.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21173","title":"Microsoft .NET 特权提升漏洞","description":".NET 框架及 .NET Core 运行时存在权限提升漏洞。该漏洞源于 .NET 在处理特权提升相关的安全边界校验时存在缺陷，攻击者在具备本地访问权限、且能操控受影响进程执行环境的情况下，可利用该缺陷绕过既有安全限制，导致权限提升。该漏洞需要攻击者已获得一定本地访问基础并具备较低权限（CVSS 局部访问、低复杂度、需用户交互），危害等级为高危。成功利用后攻击者可能篡改宿主进程权限或执行受限操作，从而影响系统完整性与机密性。Microsoft 已在其 2025 年 1 月安全更新中针对相关 .NET 版本发布修复补丁，建议用户尽快升级至受支持的更新版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21173"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:41Z","remediation":"将 .NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.12 或更高版本，.NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.1 或更高版本；将 Visual Studio 2022 17.6 升级至 17.6.22、17.8 升级至 17.8.17、17.10 升级至 17.10.10、17.12 升级至 17.12.4 或更高版本。可通过 dotnet SDK 官方安装包或 Visual Studio 更新程序安装对应安全更新。临时缓解措施：限制低权限用户对临时目录的写入权限，并避免以交互方式运行不受信任的 .NET 应用程序。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21173","https://www.herodevs.com/vulnerability-directory/cve-2025-21173","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21173.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21173.json","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e10116715f6c5d14f0b7f3bdd8bc5f9d5b3b368/release-notes/9.0/cve.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e10116715f6c5d14f0b7f3bdd8bc5f9d5b3b368/release-notes/8.0/cve.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21173.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21173.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21173.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21173.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-21173.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-21173.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0636.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0635","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0635.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21172","title":"Microsoft .NET 和 Visual Studio 远程代码执行漏洞","description":".NET 和 Visual Studio 存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），由于 .NET 运行时在处理特制输入时未正确验证堆内存边界，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开恶意文件或访问特制网站触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高（AC:H），需要用户交互（UI:R），但无需身份认证，影响 .NET 6.0/8.0/9.0 及 Visual Studio 2022 等版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21172"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:41Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：将 .NET 9.0 升级至 9.0.1 或更高版本，将 .NET 8.0 升级至 8.0.12 或更高版本，将 .NET 6.0 升级至 6.0.36 或更高版本；同时通过 Visual Studio Installer 将 Visual Studio 2022 更新至最新版本（v17.12.x 或 v17.13.x）。如无法立即打补丁，可限制用户打开来自不可信来源的解决方案文件，并启用 Windows Defender Attack Surface Reduction (ASR) 规则以阻止 Office 应用程序创建子进程作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21172","https://www.herodevs.com/vulnerability-directory/cve-2025-21172","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21172.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21172.json","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e10116715f6c5d14f0b7f3bdd8bc5f9d5b3b368/release-notes/9.0/cve.md","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e10116715f6c5d14f0b7f3bdd8bc5f9d5b3b368/release-notes/8.0/cve.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-36853.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21172.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21172.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4e910e4fa4fa60cd85b2b05bafb6fc9b27009a2d/proposals/owasp-asi/CVE-2025-21172.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21172.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21172.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0635.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0634","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0634.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21171","title":"Microsoft .NET 远程代码执行漏洞","description":".NET 运行时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制文件或访问恶意服务器触发该漏洞，在目标系统上实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 .NET 9.0 及之前版本，攻击复杂度较高且需要用户交互，但成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统，造成机密性、完整性和可用性全面受损。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21171"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:41Z","remediation":"该漏洞无有效缓解因素，必须通过升级修复。建议将所有 .NET 9.0 运行时和 SDK 升级到 9.0.1（SDK 9.0.100）：先运行 `dotnet --info` 确认当前版本，然后从 https://dotnet.microsoft.com/download/dotnet-core/9.0 下载安装 .NET 9.0.1 Runtime 或 9.0.100 SDK，安装后重启全部应用使更新生效；使用 Visual Studio 的开发者应一并更新 Visual Studio 以同步升级 .NET SDK。若项目通过 NuGet 引用受影响的 Microsoft.NetCore.App.Runtime.* 系列包，请将包引用更新到 9.0.1。已发布为自包含（self-contained）部署的应用同样受影响，必须用修复后的运行时重新编译并重新部署。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21171","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/81757a559270348b5ed9f7df6d4fbf1e7a4fae68/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21171.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21171.json","https://github.com/dotnet/core/blob/0e10116715f6c5d14f0b7f3bdd8bc5f9d5b3b368/release-notes/9.0/cve.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21171.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21171.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4e910e4fa4fa60cd85b2b05bafb6fc9b27009a2d/proposals/owasp-asi/CVE-2025-21171.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/314fd625b02aeddf863134344be1f5473864dd78/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-21171.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03a7e425813b5ae0ce33712378801e4e929dbdb7/GHSA/data/2025/CVE-2025-21171.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1